      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.78 (up from ₹3.67 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹5.56b (down 4.9% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹173.6m (up 3.0% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.1% (up from 2.9% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 5% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
